       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. SUMEVENNUMBERS.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01 I PIC 9(3).
       01 TOTAL PIC 9(5) VALUE 0.

       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
           PERFORM VARYING I FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL I > 20
               IF FUNCTION MOD(I, 2) = 0
                   ADD I TO TOTAL
               END-IF
           END-PERFORM
           DISPLAY "TOTAL: " TOTAL
           STOP RUN.
